OL,3,CBurnham 'exchanged messages with
OL,4,Csomeone impersonating Trump's chief of
OL,5,Cstaff'
OL,7,FAndy Burnham exchanged messages with
OL,8,Fsomeone impersonating Donald Trump's
OL,9,Fchief of staff, it has been reported.
OL,11,FThe Prime Minister was in contact with
OL,12,Fan unknown individual pretending to be
OL,13,Ftop White House aide Susie Wiles
OL,14,Fbefore concerns were raised about the
OL,15,Fincident, Politico's Playbook said.
OL,17,FThe publication said Burnham became
OL,18,Fsuspicious about the contact and
OL,19,Fceased communication.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/5
