CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F303A1786970910
OL,3,CBurnham 'exchanged messages with
OL,4,Csomeone impersonating Trump's chief of
OL,5,Cstaff'
OL,7,FNo messages of significance were sent
OL,8,Fand the activity was quickly shared
OL,9,Fwith the appropriate authorities, it
OL,10,Fwas reported.
OL,12,FThe British embassy in Washington was
OL,13,Fsaid to be so concerned it raised the
OL,14,Fmatter with the White House.
OL,16,FA UK Government spokesperson said: "We
OL,17,Fdo not comment on national security
OL,18,Fmatters."
