OL,3,CBurnham 'exchanged messages with
OL,4,Csomeone impersonating Trump's chief of
OL,5,Cstaff'
OL,7,FSubscribe for free to our weekly
OL,8,Fnewsletter for exclusive and original
OL,9,Fcoverage from ITV News. Direct to your
OL,10,Finbox every Friday morning.
OL,12,FIt was reported last year that the FBI
OL,13,Fwas launching an investigation into
OL,14,Fefforts to access Wiles' personal
OL,15,Fphone, after an unknown person
OL,16,Fcontacted prominent Republicans and
OL,17,Fbusiness chiefs pretending to be her.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/5
