OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F303A1786970910
OL,3,CBurnham 'exchanged messages with
OL,4,Csomeone impersonating Trump's chief of
OL,5,Cstaff'
OL,7,FWiles had asked people to disregard
OL,8,Fmessages and calls that weren't coming
OL,9,Ffrom her number, the Wall Street
OL,10,FJournal said.
OL,12,FIt is not yet known if these incidents
OL,13,Fare linked.
OL,15,FThe content of the messages between
OL,16,FBurnham and the impersonator is not
OL,17,Fknown, but the exchange is believed to
OL,18,Fhave happened after he succeeded Sir
OL,19,FKeir Starmer as prime minister on July
OL,20,F20.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G4/5
